  "content": "<center>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/label.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/progress.png\" width=\"621\" height=\"35\"></p>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-gui-hud-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/dark_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/bedrock_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<p><img style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: center; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/showcase.png\"></p>\n\n</center>\n<hr>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p>&laquo;厭倦了Minecraft最基本的介面了嗎？厭倦了每次靠近附魔台，卻只看到跟工作台一樣的灰色選單嗎？想為你的遊戲增添一些色彩嗎？</p>\n<p>為您隆重介紹「五彩繽紛的容器」！這款材質包能將容器介面更換成符合Minecraft中每個彩色實體方塊的獨特樣式。&raquo;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>- Chris XENO</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h2 style=\"line-height: normal;\">而現在，我為您帶來完全<strong>重</strong>製、<strong>重</strong>新紋理化、<strong>重</strong>新構想的版本 &ndash; Recolourful Containers，支援新版本、全新紋理，甚至更高的沉浸感！</h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\">所有GUI都從其相關區塊中汲取靈感進行了更改。修復了原版Minecraft紋理、HUD更改，甚至原版中的動畫GUI以及更多<strong>精彩內容！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/changes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>更改紋理圖示：</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/graphic.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2988\" height=\"5328\"></p>\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>更改紋理列表：</summary>\n<ul>\n<li>工作台</li>\n<li>鐵砧&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>附魔台&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>釀造台</li>\n<li>紡織機</li>\n<li>製圖台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>切石機&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>砂輪</li>\n<li>鍛造台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>合成器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>投擲器、發射器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>熔爐、高爐、煙燻爐&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n<li>儲物箱</li>\n<li>儲物箱船 <em>(1.21.2+)</em></li>\n<li>儲物箱礦車</li>\n<li>鸚鵡螺和殭屍鸚鵡螺</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>物品欄</li>\n<li>配方手冊</li>\n<li>書</li>\n<li>烽火台</li>\n<li>HUD</li>\n<li>經驗值條&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>一些小型UI更改和修復</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>「原版+」功能 </strong>(請閱讀「安裝指南」以獲取更多資訊)<strong>：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>具有職業的村民GUI&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>終界箱&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>馬、骷髏馬、殭屍馬</li>\n<li>駱馬、騾子、驢子、羊駝</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>OptiFine/OptiGUI 功能：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>具有所有類型和職業組合的村民GUI <em>(僅限 OptiGUI)&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(僅限 Animatica)</em></li>\n<li>終界箱</li>\n<li>陷阱儲物箱</li>\n<li>聖誕節儲物箱</li>\n<li>銅製儲物箱及其變種 <em>(僅限 OptiGUI)</em></li>\n<li>木桶 <em>(僅限 OptiGUI)</em></li>\n<li>彩色界伏盒</li>\n<li>馬、骷髏馬、殭屍馬</li>\n<li>駱馬、騾子、驢子（有或沒有儲物箱 - <em>僅限 OptiGUI</em>）</li>\n<li>羊駝（含地毯顏色）</li>\n<li>受損、損壞的鐵砧 <em>(僅限 OptiGUI)</em></li>\n<li>寫好的書 <em>(僅限 OptiGUI+Animatica)&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>講台上的書 <em>(僅限 OptiGUI 3.0+)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>模組支援：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Accessories</li>\n<li>Armor Chroma</li>\n<li>Axiom</li>\n<li>Backslot <em>(僅限 OptiGUI)</em></li>\n<li>Charm of Undying <em>(僅限 OptiGUI)</em></li>\n<li>Better Enchanting</li>\n<li>Cloth Config</li>\n<li>Detail Armor Bar</li>\n<li>ItemSwapper</li>\n<li>Language Reload</li>\n<li>Mod Menu</li>\n<li>Recursive Resources</li>\n<li>Sawmill</li>\n<li>What Are They Up To</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/installation.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<center>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">若想獲得完整體驗，需要安裝 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine</h3>\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/optigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optigui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://optifine.net/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optifine.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n</center>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>若您不想使用 OptiGUI，或僅使用 OptiFine 模組，您可以在語言設定中啟用內建的「原版+」模式</h3>\n\n<details>\n<summary>使用方法：</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/vanilla_version.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1390\" height=\"340\"></p>\n<p>如需其他語言支援，請使用版本頁面底部主檔案下方的獨立「原版+」材質包</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/modrinth_additional_files.png\" width=\"627\" height=\"267\" alt=\"\"></p>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/q&a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"103\"></p>\n<details>\n<summary>問與答：</summary>\n<h4><strong>問：我可以到哪裡詢問任何問題（不在此列表中的項目）？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>加入<a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Recolourful Discord 伺服器</a>並在那裡發問！</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>已知問題列表：</summary>\n<h4><strong>關於 OptiFine：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>村民職業無法運作</li>\n<li>木桶顯示儲物箱GUI紋理</li>\n<li>儲物箱船顯示最後訪問過的儲物箱式容器GUI紋理</li>\n<li>某些類似馬的生物不受支援</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若您僅使用 OptiFine，建議使用「原版+」模式</p>\n</details>\n\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>問：儲物箱/界伏盒/村民職業GUI無法運作！</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>請確認您已安裝 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine，或將語言更改為「原版+」</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：您可以新增對 X 模組的支援嗎？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>簡短回答：理論上可以。請在留言區留下您的建議，或在 Discord 中提交！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：我可以在模組包中使用 Recolourful Containers 嗎？/ 我可以修改 Recolourful Containers 嗎？/ 我可以對 Recolourful Containers 做 X 事嗎？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>請查閱描述底部的使用條款</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：我想支持您！我該怎麼做？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>關於這個嘛……</p>\n</details>\n\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/support.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3086\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1501\" height=\"160\"></a></p>\n<h3>若您不需要伺服器，但仍想支持我，請<strong>將此材質包分享給您的朋友，或在 YouTube、TikTok、Instagram 等平台展示！</strong>只要留下此頁面的連結，我將非常感激！</h3>\n<hr>\n<center>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>別忘了按讚和追蹤以獲取未來更新！</strong></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/modrinth.png\" width=\"215\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"60\"></a></p>\n</center>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/credits.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/chris_xeno/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Chris_XENO</a></strong> 感謝他原創的 Colourful Containers 材質包</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Shrimpsnail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Shrimpsnail</a></strong> 感謝他協助自訂著色器程式碼，許多功能因他而得以實現</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Kryqu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Kryqu</a></strong> 感謝他為村民GUI帶來的靈感</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/terms.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>使用條款：</summary>\n<p><strong>如果您認為自己無法對此材質包進行某些操作，請預先知會我 :)</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>您可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>將此材質包包含在免費的模組包中</li>\n<li>將此材質包用於您的私人伺服器</li>\n<li>修改此材質包（僅限個人使用）</li>\n<li>在任何形式的媒體中使用此材質包，包括 YouTube、Twitch 等</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>您不可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>未經我的同意，以任何形式在任何平台上散佈此材質包、其素材及修改後的素材</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<hr>",
